00:11:06.937 --> 00:11:07.770
Yeah.

305
00:11:07.770 --> 00:11:11.990
And to figure out like how you approach these things.

306
00:11:11.990 --> 00:11:14.740
And I think, so when is this, in early March?

307
00:11:14.740 --> 00:11:15.573
March 5th.

308
00:11:15.573 --> 00:11:16.580
March 5th, so-

