2798
01:52:29.490 --> 01:52:31.290
to see him do that time and time again,

2799
01:52:31.290 --> 01:52:32.763
and has impacted me.

2800
01:52:33.670 --> 01:52:35.730
I think in terms of leadership,

2801
01:52:35.730 --> 01:52:38.827
