2802
01:52:38.827 --> 01:52:43.030
Not over-indexing for short-term profitability

2803
01:52:43.030 --> 01:52:46.000
or productivity, but rather thinking broadly

2804
01:52:46.000 --> 01:52:49.040
about creating and establishing sustainable systems

2805
01:52:49.040 --> 01:52:50.510
that allow people to flourish

2806
01:52:50.510 --> 01:52:51.792
and do their best work,

2807
01:52:51.792 --> 01:52:54.460
not in a highly pressurized environment,

2808
01:52:54.460 --> 01:52:56.561
but giving them a little bit of bandwidth

2809
01:52:56.561 --> 01:53:01.561
so that they can feel secure in their expression.

2810
01:53:02.910 --> 01:53:04.466
I think is huge.

2811
01:53:04.466 --> 01:53:07.300
